        <mxCell id="ikpis" value="&lt;b&gt;As-Is pain points (event-log evidence)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b03a2e&quot;&gt;- User-response dead time: median 12.8 h (top bottleneck)&lt;br&gt;- 19% of fixes fail once; 22% of cases escalate and repeat diagnosis&lt;br&gt;- Escalation waits: median 5.2 h before Incident Manager engages&lt;br&gt;- Service Desk Agent performs 7 of 11 manual tasks (single point of failure)&lt;br&gt;- Knowledge base not consulted during diagnosis&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
